    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shingles,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ. ἐσθιόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.22
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπήν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆνος</span>, ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.64
			</span></i> ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπήνη</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				377.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπης, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
					ὁ,</span> name of an animal
			(snake ?), <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				30.116
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				19.1
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπητες</span> cod.).</div>
